  "Title": "ELSA-2026-100563:  java-17-openjdk security update for RHEL 8 (CRITICAL)",
  "Description": "[1:17.0.21.1.2-2.1.0.1]\n- Add Oracle vendor bug URL [Orabug: 34340155]\n\n[1:17.0.21.1.2-2.1]\n- Bump portablerelease to 2 for new final tarball\n- Update sources to new final tarball for jdk-17.0.21+9 (GA)\n- Update NEWS for new final jdk-17.0.21.1+2 (GA) tarball\n- Synchronize NEWS release notes from private-gnu_andrew-rhel-7.9-vanilla\n- Synchronize java-17-openjdk-portable.specfile from openjdk-portable-rhel-8\n\n[1:17.0.21.1.2-1.1]\n- Update to jdk-17.0.21.1+2 (GA)\n- Add to .gitignore openjdk-17.0.21.1+2.tar.xz\n- Set patchver to 1\n- Set buildver to 2\n- Set portablerelease to 1\n- Update sources to openjdk-17.0.21.1+2.tar.xz\n- ** This tarball is embargoed until 2026-11-17 @ 1pm PT. **\n- Set bundled freetype version to 2.15.0\n- Set bundled libpng version to 1.6.59\n- Update NEWS for jdk-17.0.21.1+2 (GA)\n- Set tzdata requires and build requires to 2026f\n- Synchronize java-17-openjdk-portable.specfile from openjdk-portable-rhel-8\n\n[1:17.0.21.0.9-2.1]\n- Add CheckCerts.java file\n- Add source line for CheckCerts.java\n- Compile and run CheckCerts.java in check section\n\n[1:17.0.21.0.9-2.1]\n- Bump rpmrelease to 2 for new final portable\n- Update sources to new final tarball for jdk-17.0.21+9 (GA)\n- Update NEWS with CVE list\n- Synchronize java-17-openjdk-portable.specfile from openjdk-portable-rhel-8\n\n[1:17.0.21.0.9-1.1]\n- Update to jdk-17.0.21+9 (GA)\n- Add to .gitignore openjdk-17.0.21+9.tar.xz\n- Set updatever to 21\n- Set patchver to 0\n- Set buildver to 9\n- Update sources to openjdk-17.0.21+9.tar.xz\n- ** This tarball is embargoed until 2026-10-20 @ 1pm PT. **\n- Update NEWS for jdk-17.0.21+9 (GA)\n- Set fipsver to 028d2d4a596\n- Synchronize java-17-openjdk-portable.specfile from openjdk-portable-rhel-8\n- Set tzdata requires and build requires to 2026e",
